      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, these are good. I noticed a pretty big difference in the \"vibe\" you gave them. For the Oak Ridge one, you used words like \"stately\" and \"traditional,\" but for the West End, you went with \"urban grit\" and \"eclectic.\" \n\nCan you explain why you chose those specific descriptors for the two different areas? I want to make sure I understand the marketing angle you're going for when we present these to the clients.",
